Target Master

Welcome to Target Master!

Target Master is an archery game where players aim, shoot, and compete to achieve high scores and chase some of the biggest prizes in the world.

How it works

Take aim, shoot your arrows, improve your accuracy, and try to achieve the highest score. The game is designed to provide a fun and competitive archery experience.

Google Sign-In

Target Master may use Google Sign-In to allow players to securely sign in to the game. Google account information is used only for the purposes described in our Privacy Policy.

